  "description": "An OAuth 2.1 authorization server for a remote MCP server, on OpenIddict: authorization code with PKCE S256 only, hashed reference tokens, audience pinned to the MCP endpoint, RFC 8707 resource indicators, RFC 9728 discovery, client id metadata documents, a POST-only owner consent page and per-call revocation. The host keeps its connections; the package keeps the protocol.",
